### List the users of the report
GET http://localhost:8080/some
Accept: application/json

### List locations
GET http://localhost:8080/locations
Accept: application/json

### List configurations
GET http://localhost:8080/configurations
Accept: application/json

### Create a configuration
POST http://localhost:8080/configurations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "name": "default"
}

### Create a draft configuration
POST http://localhost:8080/drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "name": "draft"
}

### Create a configuration, split specification
POST http://localhost:8080/split/configurations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "name": "split"
}
